Apple has set new CEO John Ternus' target compensation at &#36;58 million, according to an updated SEC filing [<a href="https://d18rn0p25nwr6d.cloudfront.net/CIK-0000320193/267c15fa-d3b6-4b5b-9bd0-3b187635d9eb.pdf">PDF</a>]. <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/tim-cook/">Tim Cook</a>'s target compensation is &#36;47 million in his new role as executive chairman.<br/>
